{"text": "From: Maricel Dumalagan <maricel.dumalagan@prairiemail.example>\nTo: Priscilla Hiebert <phiebert@hiebertwolanski.example>\nCc: rodel.d@prairiemail.example\nDate: Sat, 28 Feb 2026 21:47:12 -0600\nSubject: Re: 2025 T1 checklist - Dumalagan family (client HW-4418)\n\nHi Priscilla,\n\nSorry this is late, Rodel was on nights all month. Here is everything on your checklist. The slips are in the portal folder, I'm just typing the numbers so you have them in one place.\n\n1) US\nMe: Maricel A. Dumalagan, SIN 615-614-740, born March 2 1988\nRodel Dumalagan, SIN 107 431 645, DOB 1986-07-19\nWe moved on Aug 1, 2025 from 7-1190 Henderson Hwy to 412 Larchdale Crescent, Winnipeg MB R2K 1V7. Same phone 204-555-0155, Rodel's cell is 431-555-0121.\n\n2) KIDS\nAlthea - May 9, 2015 - SIN 627698780 (we got her one for the RESP)\nJoaquin (\"Wakin\") - Oct. 27, 2019 - no SIN yet\nJoaquin is at Voyageur Kids Child Care Co-op full days, receipts total $7,480.00 (their BN is 81442 7705 RR0001). Althea is in the before-and-after program at Ecole Bonaventure School, $2,160.\n\n3) SLIPS\nMy T4 from Kildonan Pines Personal Care Home: box 14 $52,318.44, tax deducted 8,104.27, union dues 611.52 (I'm in the health care aides' local).\nRodel's T4 from Transcona Railcar Works Ltd.: $71,905.10, box 44 dues $1,112.80.\nT5 from Keewatin Savings Credit Union, $38.11.\nRRSP: Rodel put $4,200 in his RRSP at Keewatin, contract no. RSP-0041877. Of that, $1,500 was on Feb 20, 2026 (first 60 days).\n\n4) MEDICAL\n- Althea's braces at Henderson Smiles Orthodontics, $3,950 (paid 2,000 so far)\n- Rodel's CPAP machine for his sleep apnea, $1,289\n- Joaquin's speech therapy, not covered, $1,640. You said last year we should do the T2201 for his autism diagnosis. Dr. Achieng Otieno signed the form on Jan 14, it's in the folder.\n\n5) OTHER\n- I sent $6,000 to my mother in Batangas over the year (tuition for my sister). I know it's probably not deductible but you asked.\n- Canada Child Benefit and the GST credit should keep going to my account: Keewatin Savings Credit Union, transit 04417, institution 879, account 1002288417. Rodel's refund goes to the joint one, same transit, acct 1002291056.\n- CRA sign-in: user ID mdumalagan88, password Bahay-Kubo#2015. Security question (mother's birthplace) = Tagaytay. Rodel uses the Sign-In Partner through the credit union so there is no password, but his NETFILE access code from last year's notice is 7K4T9B2Q.\n- I became a Canadian citizen on Sept 12, 2025!! Rodel is still PR, his card expires 2027.\n\nCan you tell us roughly what we owe or get back before March 20? We're trying to decide about the van (2019 Sienna).\n\nSalamat,\nMaricel\n204-555-0155\n\n> On Tue, Feb 17, 2026 at 9:02 AM Tyler Wolanski <admin@hiebertwolanski.example> wrote:\n> Hi Maricel, Priscilla asked me to send the 2025 checklist (attached). Our fee this year is $420 + GST for the couple, by e-transfer to payments@hiebertwolanski.example. Please don't email your SINs, use the portal: https://portal.hiebertwolanski.example/c/HW-4418\n> Tyler\n> Hiebert & Wolanski Chartered Professional Accountants | 204-555-0109 | 3-845 Corydon Avenue, Winnipeg, MB R3M 0W8", "kind": "Email", "detail": "503 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Maricel A. Dumalagan", "Rodel Dumalagan", "Althea", "Joaquin", "Maricel", "Priscilla", "Rodel"], "companies": ["prairiemail", "hiebertwolanski", "Hull Winnipeg", "Voyageur Kids Child Care Co-op", "Ecole Bonaventure School", "Transcona Railcar Works Ltd.", "Keewatin Savings Credit Union", "Henderson Smiles Orthodontics", "Keewatin", "Hiebert & Wolanski Chartered Professional Accountants"]}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "importMs": 1.5, "modelMs": 42694.699999999255, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "phone", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "street", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "n